F ResolveCanvasBands       | CanvasPanel.h | 129    | api,nonallocating,nonthrowing | ✔️ | Resolves the three bands from a body rectangle.
    in    Extents  const LayoutExtents&  [-]   layout extents from theme
    in    Body     WorkspaceRectangle    [px]  the panel's body rectangle
    out   -        Bands                 [px]  the three resolved bands
    by    Source/CanvasPanel.cpp
    note  📝 The header takes its declared height, footer takes its declared height, canvas takes the remainder.

